sequenceDiagram
    Frontend->>WebSocket: Set manual height to 1200mm
    WebSocket->>Apache Kafka: Push WebSocket message
    Apache Kafka->>DeskService: Poll WebSocket message
    DeskService->>Desk REST API: Set desk height to 1200mm
    DeskDataIngestionService->>Desk REST API: Poll desk height
    DeskDataIngestionService->>Apache Kafka: Push new desk height event message
    Apache Kafka->>DeskService: On new desk height event (1100mm)
    Apache Kafka->>WebSocket: On new desk height event (1100mm)
    WebSocket->>Frontend: Set current desk height to 1100mm